Redeclaring a name in the same scope is a no-op (diag.redeclare_is_noop),
including :DECLARE of a parameter; the message names the first
declaration's line. Names compare case-insensitively.
-- input.ssl --
:DECLARE nRound;
:DECLARE NROUND;
:PROCEDURE Merge;
	:PARAMETERS aLeft, aRight;
	:DECLARE aMerged, aRight;
	aMerged := aLeft;
	:RETURN aMerged;
:ENDPROC;
nRound := 1;
-- format --
:DECLARE nRound;
:DECLARE NROUND;

:PROCEDURE Merge;
	:PARAMETERS aLeft, aRight;
	:DECLARE aMerged, aRight;

	aMerged := aLeft;

	:RETURN aMerged;
:ENDPROC;
nRound := 1;
-- diagnostics --
